Hi,

as I've already tested 2 days ago the 5.3-BETA1 does not boot on my
AlphaPC 64 275MHz machine (with S3 Virge Graphic card).

Today I tested the same machine without the S3 Virge graphic card and it
booted ok. Than I've put in a Matrix Millennium (worked on AXPpci33) but
then I've got again a kernel trap while detecting/initializing sc0?

So from my tests the conclusion, I draw, is that FreeBSD 5.3-BETA1 works
on the above machine only when the frame buffer is removed.

Tomorrow I will test the same way my PWS 433 au.

The boot message without and with graphic card inserted and also the
config of the machine follows bellow.

Best regards
G. Ardelean

