disk2 boots and seems to run on my AS400 4/233.  Some slight glitches:
1) tl0: <Compaq Netelligent 10/100> port 0x10180-0x1018f irq 9 at device 12.0 on pci0
   reports "tl0: adapter check: 100007" when I do an ifconfig up, though
   the interface works OK.

2) Running fsck reports:
Fixit# fsck /dev/da0[ade]
fstab: /etc/fstab:0: No such file or directory
